Third-party files

This license covers the CPR&B code: patcher/*.py (except patcher/warband/),
tools/, shaders/cprb_map.fxh and the CPR&B changes inside shaders/mb.fx.

The following are by TaleWorlds Entertainment and remain under their terms; they
are included only so the mod can be built:
  src/                      Mount & Blade: Warband Module System 1.171
                            (ported to Python 3)
  patcher/warband/          headers from that Module System
  shaders/mb.fx             Warband shader source (TaleWorlds shader kit)

patcher/fx_effect.py reads the compiled Direct3D 9 effect format; its layout
follows the open source Wine project's d3dx9 effect loader.
